course: dictionary
lesson: 15207
title: Half a circle
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: «Semicircular» is a long word, but it is built from two parts you may know. Semi means half, as in semi-final, and circular means round, like a circle. Put them together and semicircular means shaped like half a circle.
explain: «The garden had a semicircular bench under the old tree.» Look at the clues: the bench is round on one side and flat on the other, like a half moon. Ask yourself what word would fit. Half-round would fit, so semicircular must mean half-round.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence: «The students sat in a half-circle around the teacher.» It still makes sense, so you have found the meaning. Semicircular is also used in maths and science, so it is a useful word to know.
fact: Semi means half, and circular means round, like a circle.
fact: «Semicircular» means shaped like half a circle.
fact: To find the area of a semicircular shape, find the area of the whole circle and then halve it.
fact: The «semicircular canals» in your inner ear help you keep your balance.
fact: A «semicircular arch» has a curved top shaped like half a circle, as seen over some doors and bridges.
exercise: «The garden had a semicircular bench under the old tree.» What does semicircular mean? | Shaped like a full circle with no gap | *Shaped like half a circle | Very long and thin | Shaped like a square
exercise: Which two parts make up the word semicircular? | circ and lar | *semi and circular | semi and circle | half and line
exercise: «The students sat in a semicircular row around the teacher.» What shape did the students make? | A full ring with no gap | *A half circle | A straight line | A triangle
test: «The rainbow looked like a semicircular arch across the sky.» Which shape is the rainbow most like? | A square | A zigzag | *Half a circle | A full circle with no gap | Shaped like a box
test: Which word means shaped like half a circle? | Triangular | Semi-final | *Semicircular | Circular
exam: Which part of the word semicircular means half? | arc | circle | circular | *semi
